    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UCOPIA is a general branching text-based adventure game that includes 13 endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An aimless traveler arrived in UCOPIA, a nation where death and suffering are absent, and where many seemingly impossible feats are achieved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the behest of a welcoming elder sister, the traveler embarked on a mission to spread the art form, visiting various exhibition halls across the country to make copies of the works on display.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was there that she encountered a peculiar young girl, lost in admiration of the artworks alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of tale and conclusion awaited these two friends?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: This game contains condemnation and preaching of real-life issues, as well as other content that may be unpleasant to some people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390890/extras/5dd3ecfd3cacbcfdf220d2b150fb6e1c.avif?t=1736053102\" width=122 height=183 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UCOPIA is a general branching text-based adventure game that includes 13 endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An aimless traveler arrived in UCOPIA, a nation where death and suffering are absent, and where many seemingly impossible feats are achieved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the behest of a welcoming elder sister, the traveler embarked on a mission to spread the art form, visiting various exhibition halls across the country to make copies of the works on display.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was there that she encountered a peculiar young girl, lost in admiration of the artworks alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of tale and conclusion awaited these two friends?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: This game contains condemnation and preaching of real-life issues, as well as other content that may be unpleasant to some people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390890/extras/5dd3ecfd3cacbcfdf220d2b150fb6e1c.avif?t=1736053102\" width=122 height=183 /></span></p>",
